# ☕ CoffeeNChill — Azure Functions, Tables, Files & Docker Hub

## Portfolio of Evidence — Part 1

CoffeeNChill is a cloud-based coffee shop solution developed using **Azure Functions, Azure Storage, Docker, Azurite, Postman, and Docker Hub**.

The purpose of the system is to replace the coffee shop's traditional paper-based processes with a simple serverless application for managing:

* ☕ Coffee menu items
* 📋 Menu item availability and pricing
* 📁 Staff documents
* 🧪 API testing
* 🐳 Containerised Azure Functions

The project was developed as a **group project consisting of four members**, with each of us responsible for specific components of the solution.

---

# 1. Project Objectives

The CoffeeNChill system was designed to demonstrate the following cloud technologies and development practices:

* Azure Functions using the **.NET Isolated Worker model**
* Azure Table Storage
* Azure File Share
* Azure Functions HTTP triggers
* Azurite for local Azure Storage emulation
* Docker containerisation
* Docker Hub image publishing
* Postman API testing
* RESTful API design
* Git and GitHub version control
* Team-based development using branches and commits

---

# 2. Technologies Used

| Technology          | Purpose                           |
| ------------------- | --------------------------------- |
| C#                  | Application programming language  |
| .NET 8              | Application framework             |
| Azure Functions v4  | Serverless HTTP API               |
| Azure Table Storage | Store menu items                  |
| Azure File Share    | Store staff documents             |
| Azurite             | Local Azure Storage emulator      |
| Docker              | Containerisation                  |
| Docker Hub          | Store and distribute Docker image |
| Postman             | API testing                       |
| Git                 | Version control                   |
| GitHub              | Source-code repository            |
| Visual Studio       | Development environment           |

---

# 3. System Architecture

The CoffeeNChill solution consists of the following main components:

```text
                         ┌─────────────────────┐
                         │      Postman        │
                         │    API Testing      │
                         └──────────┬──────────┘
                                    │
                                    ▼
                         ┌─────────────────────┐
                         │   Azure Functions   │
                         │      HTTP API       │
                         └──────────┬──────────┘
                                    │
                  ┌─────────────────┼─────────────────┐
                  │                 │                 │
                  ▼                 ▼                 ▼
          ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐
          │ Azure Table  │  │ Azure Files  │  │   Other API  │
          │  MenuItems   │  │  staff-docs  │  │   Services   │
          └──────────────┘  └──────────────┘  └──────────────┘
                  │                 │
                  └─────────────────┼─────────────────┘
                                    ▼
                              ┌───────────┐
                              │  Azurite  │
                              │   Docker  │
                              └───────────┘
```

During local development, **Azurite** emulates Azure Storage services.

