     │
     ▼
Test feature
     │
     ▼
Commit changes
     │
     ▼
Push branch
     │
     ▼
Create Pull Request
     │
     ▼
Review
     │
     ▼
Merge into main/master
```

This helped prevent individual changes from interfering with other members' work.

