* Docker
* Docker Hub
* REST APIs
* Postman
* Git
* GitHub
* Team collaboration

Each group member contributed to a specific part of the system, and the final solution integrates the individual components into a single CoffeeNChill application.

The project provides a foundation for further development into a complete cloud-based coffee shop management platform.

